# The build context is the repository root. Without this the host's bin/ and obj/ ride along and
# overwrite what the image restored, and a build inside the image then looks for packages in the
# host's NuGet folder. Everything here is either rebuilt in the image or irrelevant to the server.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.github/
.scratch/
docs/
tests/
src/AppPortal.Client/
src/AppPortal.Updater/
deploy/server.env
deploy/.env
*.md
